[h1]Phobos Shipbreaker 0.57.0[/h1]
[b]Draft - not published | 2026-10-01[/b]

[h2]Changed[/h2]

[list]
[*]A conveyor belt joins a storage container on any side of it, not only at the tile where crew use it.
[*]Every item route takes stacked products one unit at a time, as storage output already did: the F6 takes a stacked aluminium or steel scrap feed, the reclaimer and collectors take stacked packets, and a collector takes stacked ingots. Each unit is checked at its own mass, as the crew loading orders check it.
[*]Items on belt routes are shown moving along the belt (Framework 0.62.0).
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility and limits[/h2]

[list]
[*]Requires Phobos Framework 0.62.0 or newer. Nothing saved changes. Offline checks are not gameplay validation.
[/list]
